d) *[Claude]* Is a daily output of $20$ pasties and $1$ cake attainable for him? \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_

e) *[Claude]* Is a daily output of $19$ pasties attainable for him? \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_

